1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 16]</font>

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shangxue Academy]</font>

16
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we agree?</font>

17
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more of that stuff for a while.</font>

18
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have any.</font>

19
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you do, hand it over.</font>

20
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't.</font>

21
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia,</font>

22
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was about to take a hit yesterday,</font>

23
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but then I ran into him.</font>

24
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All my stuff is gone.</font>

25
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am weary.</font>

26
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let us end things here for today.</font>

27
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not</font>

28
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let this happen again.</font>

29
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Yes.
- Yes.</font>

30
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's on Prince Duan.</font>

31
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We share the same taste.</font>

32
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

33
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

34
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is
under His Majesty's watch.</font>

35
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something is off.</font>

36
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's long suffered
from blood cough syndrome.</font>

37
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This must be for pain relief.</font>

38
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who cares?</font>

39
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's find a chance</font>

40
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to probe a little.</font>

41
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brilliant.</font>

42
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So clever.</font>

43
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

44
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

45
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did Prince Duan leave?</font>

46
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right after class.</font>

47
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That master</font>

48
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sleeps all day long.</font>

49
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once class is over,</font>

50
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he slips away faster than we do.</font>

51
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did I tell you?</font>

52
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's avoiding you on purpose.</font>

53
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

54
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since he's in good health,</font>

55
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why would he hide from me?</font>

56
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, he's always been one</font>

57
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to do as he pleases.</font>

58
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't lose sleep over him.</font>

59
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since I gave Mr. Cui my word,</font>

60
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must not betray his trust.</font>

61
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's check Cui Tai's room.</font>

62
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

63
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

64
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Cui Tai's room.</font>

65
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go in and look.</font>

66
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

67
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In Cui Tai's room,</font>

68
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everything is quite tidy.</font>

69
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He liked things clean.</font>

70
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many books.</font>

71
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems he was a studious man.</font>

72
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any findings?</font>

73
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

74
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had too many pastries earlier.</font>

75
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so thirsty.</font>

76
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of water is this?</font>

77
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been days.</font>

78
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it still drinkable?</font>

79
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True.</font>

80
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

81
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go find some water.</font>

82
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

83
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

84
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What water?</font>

85
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

86
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

87
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

88
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

89
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why so eager all of a sudden?</font>

90
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has she finally seen my finer qualities?</font>

91
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has she fallen for me?</font>

92
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

93
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, it's broad daylight.</font>

94
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This isn't really proper.</font>

95
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your voice down.</font>

96
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's someone inside.</font>

97
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're mine?</font>

98
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's someone inside.</font>

99
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean someone's in the room?</font>

100
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't see anything.</font>

101
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been five full days
since Cui Tai's death.</font>

102
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet his room is spotless.</font>

103
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The teacup still has water stains.</font>

104
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone must have used it recently.</font>

105
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This person is acting suspiciously.</font>

106
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's seize them first.</font>

107
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not so fast.</font>

108
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

109
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would move into his room</font>

110
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after what happened to Cui Tai?</font>

111
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait and see.</font>

112
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We might just catch a bigger fish.</font>

113
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw that stuff.</font>

114
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Divine Dust.</font>

115
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a surprise.</font>

116
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The esteemed Prince Duan</font>

117
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">indulges himself in such a vice.</font>

118
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go catch him in the act right now.</font>

119
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we share the same interests,</font>

120
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why not find common ground?</font>

121
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're in this together now.</font>

122
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

123
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else could it mean?</font>

124
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The teacher has it.</font>

125
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We</font>

126
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are completely out of it.</font>

127
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's bring him in on it.</font>

128
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a prince.</font>

129
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't have to worry about the supply.</font>

130
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brilliant idea.</font>

131
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

132
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

133
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

134
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

135
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

136
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

137
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've come to see you.</font>

138
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you send word beforehand?</font>

139
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a whiff. Isn't it?</font>

140
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it?</font>

141
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can smell like a dog, huh?</font>

142
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

143
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's be honest here.</font>

144
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We all know</font>

145
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what's in this little bottle.</font>

146
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's inside is</font>

147
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">medicinal powder for my illness.</font>

148
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you know?</font>

149
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

150
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, don't be upset.</font>

151
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We know you're ill.</font>

152
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're using this to ease the pain.</font>

153
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only human nature.</font>

154
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We understand, right?</font>

155
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

156
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're all on the same side here.</font>

157
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to hide it from us.</font>

158
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that just Divine Dust?</font>

159
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You use this as well?</font>

160
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, Your Highness.</font>

161
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not buy more</font>

162
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and share some with us?</font>

163
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll pay you for it.</font>

164
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

165
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must I be the one to buy?</font>

166
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our tokens</font>

167
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are gone.</font>

168
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't buy anything.</font>

169
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tokens?</font>

170
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are your tokens?</font>

171
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lost.</font>

172
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lost?</font>

173
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

174
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you lose
something so important?</font>

175
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Blame that wretched Cui Tai...</font>

176
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, we can't enter
Nightfall Haven now.</font>

177
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you trust us, Your Highness,</font>

178
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could lend us your token.</font>

179
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll buy more
and bring some back for you.</font>

180
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the teacher.</font>

181
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more running errands.</font>

182
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll handle it for you, right?</font>

183
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, just look at our honest faces.</font>

184
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we look like liars?</font>

185
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

186
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can rest assured.</font>

187
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will definitely do a good job.</font>

188
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

189
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You three are far too unreliable.</font>

190
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll think it over.</font>

191
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But...</font>

192
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show some spine.</font>

193
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's some left.</font>

194
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

195
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we've been waiting here for ages.</font>

196
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure someone is really inside?</font>

197
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

198
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you can't hold out any longer,</font>

199
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can head back first.</font>

200
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not a chance.</font>

201
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must be able</font>

202
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to endure this.</font>

203
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

204
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you hungry?</font>

205
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

206
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be cold.</font>

207
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it for yourself.</font>

208
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want you catching a cold
and ruining my plan.</font>

209
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

210
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were worried about me, right?</font>

211
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can feel it.</font>

212
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

213
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's play a game.</font>

214
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

215
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What game?</font>

216
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever speaks is a puppy.</font>

217
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

218
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just spoke.</font>

219
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the puppy.</font>

220
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're out.</font>

221
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, keep up.</font>

222
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

223
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one saw you two arrive, right?</font>

224
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's late. Everyone's asleep.</font>

225
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one.</font>

226
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two keep watch at the door.</font>

227
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go in first.</font>

228
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I'm done, you come in.</font>

229
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you follow.</font>

230
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

231
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Last time, you went first.</font>

232
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go first this time.</font>

233
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, thank you.</font>

234
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

235
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have more class than you two.</font>

236
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, my father holds
the highest rank.</font>

237
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fair point.</font>

238
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make it quick.</font>

239
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

240
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't shout.</font>

241
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

242
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

243
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ghost!</font>

244
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it him?</font>

245
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't spook yourself.</font>

246
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're always so jumpy.</font>

247
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui, you're here.</font>

248
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave.</font>

249
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're leaving.</font>

250
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leaving right now.</font>

251
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now.</font>

252
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those three are absolute fools.</font>

253
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A disgrace to Shangxue Academy.</font>

254
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Cui they mentioned</font>

255
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be Cui Tai.</font>

256
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A clean conscience never fears</font>

257
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a knock at midnight.</font>

258
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid Cui Tai's death</font>

259
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is connected to them.</font>

260
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's catch a ghost.</font>

261
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Ghost.</font>

262
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these theatrics</font>

263
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to swindle their stuff.</font>

264
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch out!</font>

265
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

266
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

267
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

268
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go after him.</font>

269
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't run!</font>

270
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back and tell your prince</font>

271
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that since he has divorced me,</font>

272
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my safety</font>

273
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is no longer any of his concern.</font>

274
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak.</font>

275
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What</font>

276
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brings you here?</font>

277
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

278
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tonight,</font>

279
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we planned to go to the storage room</font>

280
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take a hit of that stuff.</font>

281
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And then we ran into a ghost.</font>

282
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A ghost?</font>

283
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I need to tell you</font>

284
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Cui Tai's ghost</font>

285
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been haunting us relentlessly.</font>

286
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Somehow,</font>

287
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whenever we use that stuff,</font>

288
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he appears.</font>

289
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The moment we use it, he's there.</font>

290
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not...</font>

291
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not...</font>

292
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop talking.</font>

293
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we just throw that thing away?</font>

294
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, he'll keep following us</font>

295
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and haunting us.</font>

296
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To appease a vengeful spirit,</font>

297
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one must first know its grievance.</font>

298
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what happens next depends</font>

299
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on whether you are willing</font>

300
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to tell me the truth.</font>

301
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

302
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all now know</font>

303
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about my important secret.</font>

304
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still not trust me?</font>

305
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

306
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We trust you.</font>

307
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, we trust you.</font>

308
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you are swamped</font>

309
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with state affairs, right?</font>

310
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should handle</font>

311
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this matter ourselves.</font>

312
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you agree?</font>

313
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

314
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll figure it out ourselves.</font>

315
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't catch the man</font>

316
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or get a clear answer</font>

317
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on what's inside the sachet.</font>

318
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even went to so many shops
to ask around,</font>

319
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he treats it
like a priceless treasure.</font>

320
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What on earth is that thing?</font>

321
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could this be the Ten-Ingredient Tonic?</font>

322
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't know
if this thing is good or bad.</font>

323
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it away for now.</font>

324
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's ask someone</font>

325
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who knows its origin.</font>

326
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who will that be?</font>

327
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's ask the ones</font>

328
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who left it to us.</font>

329
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since that ghost could scare them,</font>

330
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't we do the same?</font>

331
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop that screeching!</font>

332
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You startled me.</font>

333
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu Cheng.</font>

334
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

335
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is your method really going to work?</font>

336
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia, you still don't trust me?</font>

337
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father found the best Taoist</font>

338
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the surrounding villages.</font>

339
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said</font>

340
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that once we go
where our grudge runs deepest,</font>

341
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we pray with all our hearts,</font>

342
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will surely</font>

343
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">achieve reincarnation.</font>

344
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest easy.</font>

345
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your father was definitely lying to you.</font>

346
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look into my eyes.</font>

347
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't.</font>

348
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look into my eyes.</font>

349
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you.</font>

350
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

351
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you go first.</font>

352
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm...</font>

353
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why me?</font>

354
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go, will you?</font>

355
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm scared.</font>

356
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really scared.</font>

357
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm scared too.</font>

358
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

359
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your distance.</font>

360
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I might hit you.</font>

361
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, getting ready.</font>

362
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

363
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Done.</font>

364
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

365
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I scare those three like this?</font>

366
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

367
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even without the costume,</font>

368
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're pretty terrifying.</font>

369
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you say.</font>

370
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty sturdy, right?</font>

371
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, no.</font>

372
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

373
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My stomach suddenly hurts.</font>

374
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't hold it in.</font>

375
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

376
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no time. Hurry up.</font>

377
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about to come out.</font>

378
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

379
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia Bohou and the guys
have gone to Scholar's Grove</font>

380
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to perform memorial rites for Cui Tai.</font>

381
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Memorial rites?</font>

382
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must have a guilty conscience</font>

383
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to fall for that Taoist's nonsense.</font>

384
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

385
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time to catch some ghosts.</font>

386
00:16:43,430 --> 00:16:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

387
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:47,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

388
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:51,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

389
00:16:51,890 --> 00:16:56,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

390
00:16:56,570 --> 00:16:59,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

391
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:04,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

392
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

393
00:17:09,410 --> 00:17:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

394
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:21,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

395
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

396
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:30,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

397
00:17:30,810 --> 00:17:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

398
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

399
00:17:39,390 --> 00:17:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
